@Exsamensarbete_Karl_Pulli_HostAddress = http://localhost:5008

### ─── SPECIES ───

### Hämta alla arter
GET {{Exsamensarbete_Karl_Pulli_HostAddress}}/api/species
Accept: application/json

### Hämta en specifik art
GET {{Exsamensarbete_Karl_Pulli_HostAddress}}/api/species/3c6ccf00-c1ab-43c2-bb62-3f275a9fc38a
Accept: application/json

### Skapa ny art
POST {{Exsamensarbete_Karl_Pulli_HostAddress}}/api/species
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Abborre"
}

### Uppdatera art
PUT {{Exsamensarbete_Karl_Pulli_HostAddress}}/api/species/3c6ccf00-c1ab-43c2-bb62-3f275a9fc38a
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "3c6ccf00-c1ab-43c2-bb62-3f275a9fc38a",
  "name": "Gädda"
}

### Ta bort art
DELETE {{Exsamensarbete_Karl_Pulli_HostAddress}}/api/species/3c6ccf00-c1ab-43c2-bb62-3f275a9fc38a

### ─── LOCATIONS ───

### Hämta alla platser
